# ── Supabase (REQUIRED for database + auth) ────────────────────────────────
# 1. Supabase Dashboard → your project → ⚙️ Project Settings → API
# 2. Copy "Project URL"      → VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# 3. Copy "anon public" key  → VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  (safe for the browser)
# 4. NEVER put the service_role key in this file — it must stay on servers.

# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in the real values:
#   cp .env.example .env
# On Vercel: Project Settings → Environment Variables → add the same two keys.

